    "detailed_description": "Dino Precision Platformer is an intuitive platformer game in which you play as a cute little dinosaur. The main feature of the game is that the platforms on which the dinosaur must jump appear and disappear at certain points in time. There is a timer on each platform that shows when the platform will disappear. Have time to jump over before the ground goes out from under your feet!<br />\r\nThe game features cute pixel graphics, which gives the game a special atmosphere and attracts the attention of players.<br />\r\nThis platformer is perfect to relax after a hard day. Intuitive controls will allow you to immediately immerse yourself in the game, without lengthy management procedures.",
